  "body": "Right now in the dev edition, we are hiding table of contents items beyond the second level. (See also https://github.com/whatwg/wattsi/issues/53 where we contemplate not outputting them at all.)\r\n\r\nhttps://github.com/benschwarz/developers.whatwg.org/issues/59 by @silviapfeiffer indicates that it would be helpful for people to have the table of contents expandable to beyond two levels. This should be relatively easy to do with a little JavaScript.",
